#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Rock Raiders, from its boot to its main menu: first light.
#
# Nothing on the way is pressed. The setup dialog's default button is pressed
# by the machine, as a person pressing Enter would; both movies play to their
# end; the title loads its objects with the loading screen up; and at flip 4603
# it presents its main menu, which it then draws every flip while it waits.
#
# The pointer then moves onto Start Game, which the title lights up: a person's
# input reaches the title through its own window procedure.
flip 4610 move 320 222
